Patches to libcosmic's bundled iced (the `iced/` folder of the libcosmic
checkout, its own git repository) so screen readers can read libcosmic
apps (#44). Applied with `git -C <libcosmic>/iced apply` by
packaging/arch/PKGBUILD to every libcosmic copy that is built: Lapin UX's
own crates (private cargo home `cargo-lapin`) and the Settings fork
(`cargo-settings`). They change nothing unless the `a11y` feature is on.

In a sandbox: apply to ~/.cargo/git/checkouts/libcosmic-*/430f3d4/iced,
then `cargo clean -p iced_winit -p iced_widget` before building.
